      <meta name="description" its:translate="yes">Install and configure hardware sensors to check and monitor CPU temperature, including on systems with a read-only root file system</meta>

      <abstract>
        <para>
          Hardware sensors report the operating temperature of the CPU and other
          system components. Checking and monitoring this data helps you reduce
          energy costs, detect cooling problems early, and identify processes
          that put unnecessary load on the CPU. &productname; provides the
          <package>sensors</package> tool to read this data directly from your
          hardware.
        </para>
        <para><emphasis>Prerequisites:</emphasis></para>
        <itemizedlist>
          <listitem>
            <para>
              Root permissions to install the required package
            </para>
          </listitem>
        </itemizedlist>
